# Design system primitives (app)

Import from `@denser/design-system`. Full rule: `.cursor/skills/frontend-patterns/rules/design-system-primitives.md`.

## Defaults

| Need | Use | Avoid |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Scrollable list / menu / panel | `ScrollArea` with explicit height (`h-56`, `max-h-64`, `h-full min-h-0`) | `overflow-y-auto` / `overflow-auto` on wrappers |
| Tabs | `Tabs`, `TabsList`, `TabsTrigger`, `TabsContent` | Hand-rolled tab strips |
| Actions / triggers | `Button` | Raw `<button>` for product chrome |
| Option picking | `Select` (+ trigger/content/items) | `<select>`, `NativeSelect` (except native-form exceptions) |
| Message timelines | `MessageScroller` | `ScrollArea` on chat lists |

## ScrollArea in menus

```vue
<DropdownMenuContent class="w-56 overflow-hidden p-0">
  <ScrollArea class="max-h-64">
    <DropdownMenuItem v-for="item in items" :key="item.id">…</DropdownMenuItem>
  </ScrollArea>
</DropdownMenuContent>
```

## Exceptions

- Virtualized or DS-owned scroll roots (`MessageScroller`, etc.)
- `overflow-hidden` for clipping only (not scrolling)
- `NativeSelect` only when native semantics are intentional (calendar internals, documented form exceptions)
